#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0098 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "TELL for finding AD0098-F1 (WARNING). SCOPE-GATE skip on the class axis: class OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE not in Scope.Classes.Include [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE]. The PMDA sheet's Domains cell names OCCDS, ADAE and MDOCCDS, so this fixture is the offending record the rule cannot see today. Pins CURRENT behaviour rather than a proposal - contrast with PMDA-AD0099, whose OCCDS scenario IS a D9 red, is deliberate and is the evidence gradient the lane should rule on."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE class=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ASDY    type=Num
col AEDY    type=Num
---
